        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SpikerMan is an RPG with a large explorable world, colorful characters, and uses the LMBS (Linear Motion Battle System), a combat system that takes place in real time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use a variety of attacks that can be equipped at once by using a combination of one button and holding down the movement buttons. <br><br>Level up to learn new attacks for you and your teammates. You will even learn to use Super Powerful Moves as you continue to grow stronger.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SpikerMan is an eager teenager who wants to become a great and unstoppable warrior. Along his journey he will fight against  a great number of foes, evil space emperors, crime lords, pirates, overlords, and even space gods.</strong><br><strong>Gather your teammates, journey to other planets, complete side quests, gain power, and save the universe!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955540/extras/d667f8ec53a4ba75be710cfba121cd2f.poster.avif?t=1758029845\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955540/extras/d667f8ec53a4ba75be710cfba121cd2f.webm?t=1758029845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955540/extras/d667f8ec53a4ba75be710cfba121cd2f.mp4?t=1758029845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955540/extras/fce2a3bdb665a2b95e0e03cebac29642.poster.avif?t=1758029845\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass